  "historyNote": "#6837, Interim, eff 9-1-98, EXPIRED: 12-30-98 New. #6924, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRED: 1-1-07 New. #9441-A, eff 6-9-11; ss by #12968, eff 1-3-20 (formerly Liq 1102.03)",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
